# Agent / harness state — local working notes, not SDK source.
# Also load-bearing for the lint gate: from ruff 0.16.0 onwards `ruff format`
# checks python fences inside .md files, and ruff walks the working tree rather
# than the index. Without this entry a local run would check .claude/**/*.md
# that CI (which only has committed content) cannot see — different file counts
# local vs CI, which is exactly how the ruff 0.16.0 incident was diagnosed.
# `respect-gitignore` defaults to true, so this entry is what keeps the two
# in agreement; no [tool.ruff] extend-exclude is needed. (TD-006)
.claude/
